      {
        "description": "Solve a whole room at once from a furniture list and optional constraints (for example bed facing south, wardrobe, nightstand). Returns one proposal with every placement as a ghost. Use this for requests like '布置好卧室' instead of adding items one by one. Existing furniture stays as obstacles unless options.replaceExisting is true.",
